  "raw": {
    "https://www.iwu.edu/admissions/deposit.html": {
      "title": "Enrollment Deposit",
      "description": "Submit your enrollment deposit to Illinois Wesleyan University Skip to main content Skip to main navigation Skip to footer content Illinois Wesleyan Menu Close Menu Current Students Faculty/Staff Alumni Parents MyIWU Give News Illinois Wesleyan Admissions Admissions Overview Request Information Schedule a Visit Virtual Tour Apply Today Cost & Financial Aid Submit Deposit Transfer to IWU International Students College Counselors Contact Us Academics Academics Overview Majors + Minors Academic Calendar Course Catalog Student Success Ames Library Summer Term Undergraduate Research International Office Campus Life Campus Life Overview Career Center Counseling & Consultation Services Dining Fraternities & Sororities Health Services Housing Office of Campus Culture Student Organizations Resources for Commuters About About Illinois Wesleyan Campus Map Directory Offices & Departments Visitor Info Fast Facts & Bragging Points Conferences, Camps & Reservations University Policies ATHLETICS Admissions Home Admissions Enrollment Deposit Enrollment Deposit Admissions About Admissions Overview Liberal Arts Advantage National Reputation Bloomington-Normal Rankings Summer Term College Counselors Apply How to Apply Titan App Admissions Criteria International Students Transfer Students Application Status Admitted Students Submit Deposit Enrollment Checklist Housing Information Academic Calendar Visit Arrange a Visit Directions Campus Map Hotels Contact Find Your Counselor On the Road Request Information Afford Estimate Your Cost Financial Aid Types of Aid Scholarships Tuition & Fees Finding a Major Outcomes Bragging Points Graduate Success Value of a Liberal Arts Education College Counselors Congratulations on your decision to enroll at Illinois Wesleyan! Kiplinger's Personal Finance calls us a best value, the Economist reports our graduates earn top dollar, U.S. News & World Report puts us in the top-tier of national liberal arts colleges and we're confident that\n                     you'll add to our reputation in the years to come. To confirm your intention to enroll, you will need to submit the $350 non-refundable enrollment\n                     fee. Once it is received, you will receive further information regarding housing,\n                     orientation, and course registration. If you have questions, there are plenty of answers on our website, or you can contact your admissions counselor or the Office of Financial Aid . Deposit Payment Options You can send a check to Illinois Wesleyan University, Office of Admissions, P.O. Box\n                     2900, Bloomington, IL, 61701. Don't forget to include your name and your application\n                     ID number found on your Student Status Portal, or simply pay online below. Online options include credit card (American Express, Discover, Master Card or Visa) 1 or having your savings or checking account debited with an ACH (automatic clearing\n                     house) 2 payment. To do so, you will need to access your Student Status Portal at admissions.iwu.edu/account/login If you're having trouble, simply call the Admissions Office at 800-332-2498 or send\n                     an email to iwuadmit@iwu.edu . One more step and you’re officially a member of this fall’s entering class! Sign into\n                        your status portal to pay now. Pay Now 1 A convenience fee is charged by the provider for credit card payment options. IWU\n                        does not charge nor collect the convenience fee. 2 There is no fee for an ACH payment. Facebook Twitter LinkedIn YoutTube Instagram TikTok 1312 Park Street Bloomington, IL 61701 United States (309) 556-1000 Academic Calendar Bookstore Directory Majors & Programs Accreditation Employment Financial Aid Library Accessibility Disclaimer of Content Non-Discrimination Privacy Policy Apply Now Request Info Visit Our Campus © Copyright 2026. All Rights Reserved ©"
    },
    "https://www.iwu.edu/career-center/": {
      "title": "Hart Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center Skip to main content Skip to main navigation Skip to footer content Illinois Wesleyan Menu Close Menu Current Students Faculty/Staff Alumni Parents MyIWU Give News Illinois Wesleyan Admissions Admissions Overview Request Information Schedule a Visit Virtual Tour Apply Today Cost & Financial Aid Submit Deposit Transfer to IWU International Students College Counselors Contact Us Academics Academics Overview Majors + Minors Academic Calendar Course Catalog Student Success Ames Library Summer Term Undergraduate Research International Office Campus Life Campus Life Overview Career Center Counseling & Consultation Services Dining Fraternities & Sororities Health Services Housing Office of Campus Culture Student Organizations Resources for Commuters About About Illinois Wesleyan Campus Map Directory Offices & Departments Visitor Info Fast Facts & Bragging Points Conferences, Camps & Reservations University Policies ATHLETICS Hart Career Center Hart Career Center About Home About Us Alumni Faculty & Staff Parents & Family Events & Signature Programs Event Calendar Career Fairs Career Immersion Excursion Students Success Starts Here Career Closet Internships Online Resources Virtual Resources Identity Resources Pre-Health Advising Graduate Success Employers Be Career Ready The Illinois Wesleyan University Hart Career Center encourages students to engage\n                     early and often to transition from college to career. Whether you are applying to\n                     graduate schools, searching for jobs, looking for internships, updating your resume,\n                     writing a cover letter, or deciding your major or career path our career advisors\n                     are here to help!  We are passionate about helping you through every step of your\n                     career journey. Handshake The Hart Career Center utilizes Handshake as our career services platform. This\n                                 includes our employer network, internship/job posting database, on-campus interviews,\n                                 professional development events, virtual career fairs, appointment scheduling with\n                                 career advisors, a resource library, and more! Activate your Handshake account to\n                                 access these free tools available to all IWU students and alumni. Schedule an Appointment Meet with a career advisor to ask all of your career-related questions! Schedule through\n                                    Handshake, email ccenter@iwu.edu, or call (309) 556-3071. Events We offer events throughout the year for professional career development including\n                                 presentations, workshops, alumni speakers, panel discussions, and more! Career Fairs Connect with recruiters from employers and graduate/professional schools that have\n                                 opportunities to share with IWU students! Internships Gain practical experience within your major or career path! Career Immersion Excursion Made possible with generous contributions from the Carswell family and kind support\n                                 from participating alumni and employers, IWU students visit a U.S. city during spring\n                                 break to be immersed in a career exploration excursion! Hiring Titans The Illinois Wesleyan University Hart Career Center offers services for employers\n                     to make it easy to hire Illinois Wesleyan students and graduates. Learn more about how employers can work with the Hart Career Center and IWU students . Contact Warren Kistner - Director of the Career Center Department - Career Center wkistner@iwu.edu (309) 556-3237 Facebook Twitter LinkedIn YoutTube Instagram TikTok 1312 Park Street Bloomington, IL 61701 United States (309) 556-1000 Academic Calendar Bookstore Directory Majors & Programs Accreditation Employment Financial Aid Library Accessibility Disclaimer of Content Non-Discrimination Privacy Policy Apply Now Request Info Visit Our Campus © Copyright 2026. All Rights Reserved ©"
    },
